sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant TC as tauri-commands.ts
    participant BD as bindings.ts (auto-gen)
    participant CM as Rust commands.rs
    participant CO as core/sidecar
    participant FS as Filesystem

    U->>FE: Click "Add comment"
    FE->>TC: addComment({ path, anchor, text })
    TC->>BD: invoke('add_comment', args)
    BD->>CM: dispatch
    CM->>CO: with_sidecar_or_create(path, |s| { s.comments.push(c) })
    CO->>FS: read_capped(yaml_path)
    FS-->>CO: bytes
    CO->>CO: reject_yaml_anchors(bytes)
    CO->>CO: serde_saphyr::from_str(...)
    CO->>CO: mutate sidecar
    CO->>CO: emit_mrsf_yaml(&sidecar)
    CO->>FS: write_atomic(yaml_path, bytes)
    FS-->>CO: Ok
    CO-->>CM: Result<MrsfSidecar>
    CM-->>BD: Result<T, E>
    BD-->>TC: Promise<T>
    TC-->>FE: T
    Note right of CM: also emits 'comments-changed'
    CM-->>FE: event 'comments-changed'
    FE->>FE: re-render
